# Additive clock connective: the hour, then "and", then the fraction or the
# minutes.  kab.wikipedia, Tafsut n Yimaziɣen:
#   "ɣef ṛṛebɛa d wezgen n tmeddit, llan ugar n 1000 n medden ..."  (16:30)
#   "ɣef leḥdac d wezgen n tṣ̣ebḥit, deg tesdawit talemmast n Ldzayer" (11:30)
#   "ɣef tizi n jjuj d wezgen n tmeddit"                              (14:30)
#   "ɣef lxemsa u xemsin"                                             (5:50)
d
u
